  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - Take Fighter
  - choose_start_ship_start_01
  - Take Frigate
  - choose_start_ship_start_02
  - Take Vestari
  - choose_start_ship_start_03
  - give_ship ship_fighter
  - spawn_encounter encounter_xeno_probe_tutorial ark_station 1
  - set_fact intro_ship_chosen true
  - give_ship ship_frigate
  - spawn_encounter encounter_xeno_probe_tutorial ark_station 1
  - set_fact intro_ship_chosen true
  - give_ship ship_vestari
  - spawn_encounter encounter_xeno_probe_tutorial ark_station 1
  - set_fact intro_ship_chosen true
  - play_sfx cue_ui_success
  - A grateful engineer joins your crew. 'I won't forget this. Let me repay you with my skills.'
  - crew_stranded_rescued_00
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - Welcome Aboard
  - crew_stranded_rescued_01
  - play_sfx cue_ui_click
  - A distress pod from a destroyed vessel floats nearby. Life signs detected inside.
  - crew_stranded_start_00
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - Rescue Survivor
  - crew_stranded_start_01
  - Ignore
  - crew_stranded_start_02
  - give_item resource_crew 1
  - crew_stranded_rescued
  - "Buried in the ice ring is a vault marked with the symbol of the 'First Ark'\u2014a mission launched 500 years ago that was presumed lost. The airlock is frozen shut."
  - cryo_vault_start_00
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - Melt Seal
  - cryo_vault_start_01
  - Use Explosives
  - cryo_vault_start_02
  - take_item resource_fuel 3
  - cryo_vault_vault_enter
  - cryo_vault_vault_damaged
  - The explosion compromises some of the samples, but you gain access. Inside are genetic samples and a custodian AI that powers down from the shock.
  - cryo_vault_vault_damaged_00
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - Salvage What You Can
  - cryo_vault_vault_damaged_01
